===Etymology===
{{etyl|enm}} {{term|devisen|lang=enm}}, {{term|devysen|lang=enm}}, from {{etyl|la}} ''[[devisare]]'', frequentative of ''[[devidere]]''.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-devise.ogg|Audio (US)}}

* {{rhymes|aɪz}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|devis|ing}}

# {{transitive}} To use one's [[intellect]] to [[plan]] or [[design]] (something).
# {{transitive}} To [[leave]] ([[property]]) in a [[will]].

